</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">One number, three owners: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">frequency (CRM), order value (merchandising), margin (pricing).
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Read it with total profit: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">winning back one-time buyers adds profit but can lower PPAC.
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Target: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">same months last year + 5%; the cards compare like-for-like months.
