</run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#62748E" fontsize="9">₹ L for profit and sales, counts otherwise  |  light violet = 80% range  |  backtest, 6 held-out months: orders -1.4%, profit -10.2%, inside the range</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="162" x="0" y="29778" w="100000" h="30222" fixed-size="272" is-fixed="true" type-v2="NONE" name="Forecast Trend" show-title="false"><layout-cache type-h="scalable" type-w="scalable"/><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone-style><format attr="background-color" value="#FFFFFF"/><format attr="border-color" value="#E2E8F0"/><format attr="border-style" value="solid"/><format attr="border-width" value="1"/><format attr="margin" value="4"/><format attr="padding" value="6"/><_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr="corner-radius" value="8"/></zone-style></zone><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="163" x="0" y="60000" w="100000" h="36667" fixed-size="330" is-fixed="true" type-v2="layout-flow" param="horz"><zone id="164" x="0" y="60000" w="55000" h="36667" fixed-size="770" is-fixed="true" type-v2="layout-flow" param="vert"><zone id="165" x="0" y="60000" w="55000" h="6444" fixed-size="58" is-fixed="true" type-v2="NONE" name="T Levers" show-title="false"><layout-cache type-h="scalable" type-w="scalable"/><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="166" x="0" y="66444" w="55000" h="30222" fixed-size="272" is-fixed="true" type-v2="NONE" name="Profit Levers" show-title="false"><layout-cache type-h="scalable" type-w="scalable"/><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone-style><format attr="background-color" value="#FFFFFF"/><format attr="border-color" value="#E2E8F0"/><format attr="border-style" value="solid"/><format attr="border-width" value="1"/><format attr="margin" value="4"/><format attr="padding" value="6"/><_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr="corner-radius" value="8"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="167" x="55000" y="60000" w="45000" h="36667" fixed-size="630" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" forceUpdate="true"><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="11">Recommended plan: start with the two cheap levers (₹20–28 L)
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">1. Pricing: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">cap item discounts at 10%, no stacking (+₹8.8–12.2 L, high confidence, no cost).
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">2. CRM: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">first-order offer to the 80 never-ordered (+₹10.8–16.0 L, medium, low cost).
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">3. CRM: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">second-order nudge, repeat rate 53% to 60% (+₹11.7 L; lowers PPAC).
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">4. Marketing: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">find out why sign-ups stopped before spending on them (+₹10.9 L at the 2024 pace).
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Size: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">levers 1+2 add 20%–29% to the ₹96.9 L baseline (scenario A); levers overlap, so don't add all four.
</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="background-color" value="#FFFFFF"/><format attr="border-color" value="#E2E8F0"/><format attr="border-style" value="solid"/><format attr="border-width" value="1"/><format attr="margin" value="4"/><format attr="padding" value="6"/><_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr="corner-radius" value="8"/></zone-style></zone><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="168" x="0" y="96667" w="100000" h="3333" fixed-size="30" is-fixed="true" type-v2="layout-flow" param="horz"><zone id="169" x="0" y="96667" w="66286" h="3333" fixed-size="928" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" forceUpdate="true"><formatted-text><run fontalignment="1" fontcolor="#5B6B7F" fontsize="8">Source: Online Sales Data, Jan 2023 – Oct 2025 · Extract 26 Nov 2026 · Profit excl. shipping, marketing · Synthetic data</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="170" x="66286" y="96667" w="8429" h="3333" fixed-size="118" is-fixed="true" type="dashboard-object"><button action="tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{EEBA663C-8D2B-43A3-8E8A-02EE114EEDD5}&quot;" button-type="text"><button-visual-state><caption>1 Retention</caption><button-caption-font-style bold="false" fontcolor="#FFFFFF" fontname="Tableau Medium"/><format attr="background-color" value="#030734"/></button-visual-state></button><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="171" x="74714" y="96667" w="8429" h="3333" fixed-size="118" is-fixed="true" type="dashboard-object"><button action="tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{6395F4B9-3DC5-4BB1-99CA-B33A90609159}&quot;" button-type="text"><button-visual-state><caption>2 P