</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">4. Marketing: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">find out why sign-ups stopped before spending on them (+₹10.9 L at the 2024 pace).
</run><run bold="true" fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#682EFF" fontsize="9">Size: </run><run fontalignment="0" fontcolor="#020618" fontsize="9">levers 1+2 add 20%–29% to the ₹96.9 L baseline (scenario A); levers overlap, so don't add all four.
</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="background-color" value="#FFFFFF"/><format attr="border-color" value="#E2E8F0"/><format attr="border-style" value="solid"/><format attr="border-width" value="1"/><format attr="margin" value="4"/><format attr="padding" value="6"/><_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr="corner-radius" value="8"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="166" x="0" y="89856" w="100000" h="6484" fixed-size="280" is-fixed="true" type-v2="NONE" name="Profit Levers" show-title="false"><layout-cache type-h="scalable" type-w="scalable"/><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="169" x="0" y="96341" w="100000" h="695" fixed-size="30" is-fixed="true" type-v2="text" forceUpdate="true"><formatted-text><run fontalignment="1" fontcolor="#5B6B7F" fontsize="8">Source: Online Sales Data, Jan 2023 – Oct 2025 · Extract 26 Nov 2026 · Profit excl. shipping, marketing · Synthetic data</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="170" x="0" y="97036" w="100000" h="695" fixed-size="30" is-fixed="true" type="dashboard-object"><button action="tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{EEBA663C-8D2B-43A3-8E8A-02EE114EEDD5}&quot;" button-type="text"><button-visual-state><caption>1 Retention</caption><button-caption-font-style bold="false" fontcolor="#FFFFFF" fontname="Tableau Medium"/><format attr="background-color" value="#030734"/></button-visual-state></button><zone-style><format attr="border-color" value="#000000"/><format attr="border-style" value="none"/><format attr="border-width" value="0"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="171" x="0" y="97730" w="100000" h="695" fixed-size="30" is-fixed="true" type="dashboard-object"><button action="tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{6395F4B9-3DC5-4BB1-99CA-B33A906091